===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|goh|schīzen}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*skītaną}}, from {{der|de|ine-pro|*skeyd-}}, {{m|ine-pro|*sḱeyd-||to part with, separate, cut off}}. Compare {{cog|nds|schieten}}, {{cog|nl|schijten}}, and English (verb) ''[[shit]]'', Danish {{m|da|skide}}.

